== Part 2: rescaled steps in finite physical time
gamma = 0.7: T after 60 steps = 1.986433863634, bound 1/(1-e^-gamma) = 1.986433863634
  amplitude after 60 steps = e^(gamma*60) = 1.739e+18; BKM sum = 60.0 (one quantum per step)
